@baseUrl=http://localhost:8086

### Get a token first by registering + logging in below, then paste it here.
@authToken=

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/info

### The consumer name is the JWT subject and must equal a dms.consumers key (onboarding-portal or crm), otherwise every DMS call returns 403 DMS109.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "authType": "JWT",
    "consumer": "onboarding-portal",
    "email": "onboarding-portal@example.com",
    "consumerPassword": "password123",
    "roles": ["APP_DOCUMENT_MANAGEMENT_SERVICE_USER"],
    "application": "document-management-service",
    "environment": "local"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "consumer": "onboarding-portal",
    "consumerPassword": "password123"
}

### List DMS filing categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dms/filing-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Save DMS document (plain form fields; metadata is a JSON text field)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dms/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=DmsBoundary

--DmsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Synthetic sample document for local testing only.
--DmsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="filingCategoryId"

42
--DmsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fileName"

sample.txt
--DmsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="metadata"

{"11329": "TEST-000001", "11330": "Passport"}
--DmsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="overwrite"

true
--DmsBoundary--

### Save DMS document -ve test case (metadata not a JSON object -> 400 DMS101)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dms/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=DmsBoundary

--DmsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Synthetic sample document for local testing only.
--DmsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="filingCategoryId"

42
--DmsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="metadata"

["TEST-000001"]
--DmsBoundary--

### Search DMS documents
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dms/documents/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "filingCategoryId": 42,
    "metadata": { "11329": "TEST-000001" },
    "page": 1,
    "pageSize": 25
}

### Search DMS documents -ve test case (pageSize over the maximum -> 400 DMS101)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dms/documents/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "filingCategoryId": 42,
    "pageSize": 101
}

### Download DMS document content
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dms/documents/88213/content
Accept: application/octet-stream, application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Download DMS document content -ve test case (documentId 0 -> 400 DMS101)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dms/documents/0/content
Accept: application/octet-stream, application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###
